      "editedAt": "2026-07-15T00:00:00Z",
      "editor": "lsorel",
      "diff": "Add cache read-through for `GET /products`. The products list is our\nhottest endpoint (about 40% of read traffic) and its data changes rarely.\nThis puts a read-through cache with a 60-second TTL in front of the\nexisting handler. No other endpoints change, and no invalidation\nmachinery is needed at this TTL."
    }
