          "author": "tverne",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-14T10:20:00Z",
          "body": "A 60-second TTL means a price change shows stale for up to a minute.\nMerchandising will file bugs the first week. Can we invalidate on write\ninstead of waiting out the TTL?",
